# =============================================================================
# DEFERRED LFS PATTERNS
#
# *.exr *.ttf *.pdf *.eps *.ai *.dll are commented out above, NOT forgotten.
#
# These formats are genuine binaries and belong in LFS. They are currently
# committed as raw Git blobs, which bloats packfiles permanently. Routing them
# into LFS would require uploading 40 new LFS objects (~70 MB), and this
# repository is over its GitHub LFS budget, so all LFS writes are refused:
#
#   batch response: This repository exceeded its LFS budget.
#
# Leaving them as raw blobs is not a regression -- it is exactly their current
# state. Uncomment these six lines once the LFS budget is restored, then run:
#
#   git add --renormalize .
#
# =============================================================================
